---
layout: page
title: Non-functional requirements
description: The qualities the service must have, and the standards they come from.
---
{% set groups = [["performance", "Performance"], ["accessibility", "Accessibility and usability"], ["security", "Security"], ["reliability", "Reliability and scalability"], ["data", "Audit and data"], ["support", "Monitoring and support"], ["quality", "Quality assurance"], ["engineering", "Engineering"]] %}

<p class="govuk-body">These are the non-functional requirements the Private Landlord work is built and tested against. Each one is a summary: follow the source link for the full wording. Pages on the HMCTS Confluence need an HMCTS account.</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Standards</h2>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
{% for s in nfrs.standards %}<li><a class="govuk-link" href="{{ s.url }}">{{ s.title }}</a>{% if s.note %} ({{ s.note | lower }}){% endif %}</li>
{% endfor %}</ul>

{% for g in groups %}
{% set items = nfrs.nfrs | where("category", g[0]) %}
{% if items | length %}
<h2 class="govuk-heading-l">{{ g[1] }}</h2>
<table class="govuk-table"><thead class="govuk-table__head"><tr class="govuk-table__row">
<th scope="col" class="govuk-table__header">ID</th><th scope="col" class="govuk-table__header">Requirement</th>
<th scope="col" class="govuk-table__header">Target</th><th scope="col" class="govuk-table__header">Source</th></tr></thead>
<tbody class="govuk-table__body">
{% for i in items | sort(false, false, "id") %}{% set s = nfrs.standards | where("id", i.source) | first %}<tr class="govuk-table__row">
<td class="govuk-table__cell">{{ i.id }}</td>
<td class="govuk-table__cell">{{ i.requirement }}</td>
<td class="govuk-table__cell">{{ i.target or "" }}</td>
<td class="govuk-table__cell"><a class="govuk-link" href="{{ i.url or s.url }}">{{ s.title }}</a>{% if i.ref %}<br><span class="govuk-body-s">{{ i.ref }}</span>{% endif %}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
<p class="govuk-body-s">{{ nfrs.nfrs | length }} requirements in total. To add or change one, open a pull request that edits <code>src/_data/nfrs.yaml</code>.</p>
